                    "process": [
                        {
                            "type": "align_justify",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "paragraph",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "text": "After physical verification by the Institute’s Surveyor Assistant, the actual cultivated area is registered. The Surveyor Assistant prepares the registration form in the prescribed format, attaches the applicant’s Aadhaar card and the land’s Khasra details, and sends it to the Director of the Herbal Research and Development Institute, mandal gopeshwar chamoli. After obtaining the Director’s approval, the concerned District Coordinator completes the registration."
